    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Working Group for Women at the Aga Khan University organised a women's day event on March 30, 2015. The two-hour programme, 'Feminine Voice of Urdu Poetry', was aimed at celebrating the less-heard yet assertive voice of women by showcasing a blend of three fine arts - poetry, music and theatre.",
